	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat040070"},
		line=635,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I search all throughout the Imperial Palace, but Himi-no-Mikoto is nowhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Suddenly recalling her intentions to come to the hillside, I rush there at once.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Begone! Insolent cur!”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"I immediately leap towards the direction of that voice.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto stands atop the hill, next to a certain other man.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"What in the world are you doing... Inou Tooru?",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Explain yourself at once!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"I interpose myself between the two of them and shield Himi-no-Mikoto behind mine back.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi?! What are you...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Sorry I took so long.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Did I not admonish you to not appear before me again?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I will accept your rebuke later.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"The problem is Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What business have you with Himi-no-Mikoto, Tooru?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Why, a marriage interview, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I am the one to decide the occasion of my marriage interviews.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I cannot abide such impropriety, even from a noble head of house.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tooru, what's gotten into you?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Everyone can change.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“And my feelings for Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, they've changed me.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I can no longer imagine any life without her!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, you and I are destined to be!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Tooru declares with an uncanny boldness.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“What's more, Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, I have a certain premonition.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“When your end comes, I shall surely be present to witness it.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Tooru's eyes stare unwaveringly into Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Within them, a dim and unfathomable darkness flickers in and out of view.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Finally sensing that all is not right, Himi-no-Mikoto shares a brief look with me before forming her lips into a tight line.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tooru, you go too far!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I draw mine blade and raise it against Tooru.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Out of my way, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama is the one I'm speaking to.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Tooru kneels before Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, will you not grant Inou Tooru your hand in marriage?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Even facing down mine blade, Tooru shows absolutely no fear.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Very well, I shall indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Do you speak truly?!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“H-Hey!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto continues with a smirk.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But under one simple condition.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Render unto me the most beautiful vista known to this world.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Only when I acknowledge the sight you've prepared as such, will I take you as my groom.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is demanding the impossible.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"So long as she never permits the word “beautiful” to pass her lips, Tooru can never hope to accomplish this task.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"That is to say, he has no hope of ever claiming her as his bride.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"However─",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“I shall have it prepared at once!”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"He must surely be laboring under some misunderstanding, as he seems only to take heart in this impossible task.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"He eagerly knocks his forehead to the ground before leaping to his feet.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Tooru"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto-sama, I beg you to not forget the vow you swore to me here today!”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Tooru bares all his teeth in a wide smile before sauntering away without a backwards glance.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Even as Tooru's long shadow disappears over the horizon, Himi-no-Mikoto does not move from where she stands.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Eventually, the sun begins to set.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I'm sorry for earlier.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wherefore do you apologize?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“First, I'm sorry that I agreed to mediate between you and Tooru.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I never expected that he would go this far.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Pay it no mind. The one at fault is Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto replies with an easy smile.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Second, I apologize for appearing before you without permission.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Oh, you certainly have that right. How unforgivable for you to ignore a direct order.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"For as much as she's complaining, though, she doesn't seem all that angry.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“And one final thing...”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I apologize for hurting your feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My feelings?”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Chihaya was most cross with me.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“She says that mine words must have wounded you terribly.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wh-What might you be implying?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Are you not in love with me?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“And so, because I proposed that you offer your hand to Tooru in marriage...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hoooold it! Hold it right there!”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wh-Who told you that?!”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Why, Chihaya─!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Er, it's apparently common knowledge throughout the palace...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Wh-What?!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Grr... The court ladies' gossip goes too far...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto grits her teeth in vexation.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“In any case, I must apologize if I've hurt your feelings because of that.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Enough. Do not say any more.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I cannot bear to hurt you, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“There is nothing I desire more than for you to always be smiling.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"For her to always be singing that carefree lullaby for me atop this hillside...",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"...That is all I could ever wish for.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Don't start acting so strangely out of nowhere. You'll leave me at a loss...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I lower mine head to Himi-no-Mikoto once again.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Stop apologizing already.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You misunderstand me. I am not upset for the reason you suspect.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Argh, you leave me no choice! Be seated! Heed me and sit down at once!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto practically pushes me onto the grass before plopping her head down on mine lap.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You would forgive mine rudeness?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Never once has it slipped my mind what an incorrigibly rude fellow you are.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That was never the cause for my anger in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Besides, I am the one who really ought to be apologizing.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's voice drops to barely above a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, know you the true nature of magicks?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Nay, I do not.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The more one invokes them, the more that magicks corrupt their user.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And once the corruption has taken one's soul, they cannot go on living, no matter the health of their corporeal body.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What do you mean to say?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My life will expire within another year or two at most.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Wh...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"I fail to immediately digest the meaning of her words.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto... is to die?",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"I know that human lives are finite.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"But never once did it occur to me that this law of nature might also apply to Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"She was always the sun in mine sky, and nary was there a doubt in mine mind that she would continue to shine down upon me, always, forevermore...",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“This is no joke, is it?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Sadly not.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto murmurs, a sorrowful smile lingering on her lips.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The affliction has already stricken my body. Needless to say, I cannot possibly hope to birth an heir.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The reason I nonetheless continue to conduct marriage interviews is to hide this very fact.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If they realize that I'll never birth an heir, the house heads will begin to recall the grand ambitions they'd sealed away in their hearts.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I cannot afford to have them raising succession disputes. Not yet.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That is why, hearing you go on and on about heirs, I could not help the blood rushing to my head.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"So it was not mine recommending Tooru that she took offense from.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The truth was in fact much graver than that.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is there nothing I can do?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You needn't do anything more.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"She nuzzles her cheek against mine lap.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I don't understand.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Just this is enough to lighten my spirits.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes flutter shut as she reclines her head on mine lap.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Yet the unease continues to twist at mine heart.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"The Persica will bloom again next spring, and the spring after that, yet mine creator will no longer be here to witness it... Is there truly nothing I can do?",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I wish to be with you.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“To live out the rest of my days by your side... I could ask for nothing more.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But─”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, you are all I need.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Seemingly on the verge of sleep, Himi-no-Mikoto whispers this to me.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"I cannot hope to fathom the depths of her noble heart.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Yet when she says, “I wish to be with you,” she means much more than for me to simply stay by her side.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"That is all I need understand.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I will always be by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“For the rest of your days, I will share in your weal and woe.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That is all I ever wished to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Smiling a contented smile, Himi-no-Mikoto hums her usual melody.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"How many more blissful days will I be able to spend listening to this song?",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Commending mine soul to her lullaby, I make this vow─",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"I am naught but a tool.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"No matter how far I may go, I will never have a true\nhuman's heart.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"But if Himi-no-Mikoto wishes it─",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"All mine heart, all mine soul, I willingly give to her.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
